            "review_title": "Review at Red Tomato",
            "review_text": "Brown NYC\n10 contributions\n0\nGreat Pizza! Great Pasta!\nDec 2019 • Family\nI've been ordering from Red Tomato for YEARS now and just noticed I've never written a review - so here we go.\n\nMy go-to order is the 4 cheese pizza - very very nice. I ask for extra-thin crust, and it comes with really generous cheese, delicious tomato sauce... And one of those crusts where you eat every bite. (Ever had a pizza where the crust was so chewy you wind up with huge shards left on your plate?)\n\nThey have interesting pastas and other dishes as well - chicken parmagiana is a big hit with my son.\n\nI always order directly from Red Tomato. If you live in D7, I wouldnt recommend any other way - they're always friendly on the phone, delivery is fast, service is great.\n\nRecommended!\nRead more\nWritten December 24, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
