            "review_title": "Review at Red Tomato",
            "review_text": "somnus04101995\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam3 contributions\n0\nAffordable and consistent\nAug 2016 • Friends\nThis is my go to place after work. If you like their food you keep coming back. There are more hits than misses. Don't expect traditional Italian, as they are more Fusion. My personal favorites are the chicken parmigiana, garlic parm shrimp spaghetti, mex salad, and jambaya penne. Quick delivery except weekends. And reservations needed on weekends. They get quite busy.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten August 30, 2016",
