            "review_text": "Christopher\n317 contributions\n0\nAverage pizza - there are better options\nAug 2016 • Couples\nWe ordered two small pizzas, they arrived, they were average. Red Tomato is inexpensive and obviously skimps a bit on quality ingredients to keep costs low. To their credit, we received two large pizzas - a mistake on their part - and they only charged us for the two smaller we ordered.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 21, 2016",
