            "review_text": "katanankes\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam90 contributions\n0\nGood fake Italian\nMar 2016 • Solo\nOf all the fake Italian restaurants in Phu My Hung and Saigon in general, Red Tomato has actually something to offer! Again, let's be clear, this is not authentic Italian food.\n\nWhat can you save: for 7 or 8 dollars you can have their chicken parmigiana that is big, meaty, well done and comes with some tomato sauce pasta and vegetables (a meal!). The pizza is not bad. Also, depending on your taste, some other dishes could be attractive (be ready for creamy pasta). \n\nBy the way, they have two locations in Phu My Hung (one in Sky Garden and one near Hung Vuong complex) and also offer delivery.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten April 16, 2016",
